The MIT licence above covers the source code only.

Some of the game's sprites are derived from GDQuest's "Your First 2D Game With
Godot 4 - 2D project assets" pack, which is licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The
NonCommercial term applies to modified assets as well as originals.

THEREFORE: THIS GAME MAY BE SHARED FREELY BUT MAY NOT BE SOLD, and may not
carry advertising or any other form of monetisation, while those assets remain
in the build.

game/LICENSE-ASSETS.md carries the full attribution block the licence requires,
a per-file statement of changes, and a list of which assets are pack-derived
and which are original work. Read it before redistributing.
